id: shard-carrier
name: Shard Carrier
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Glass Shards (1) leaves, on its user's clock - and what its other effects read.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Glass Shards: a Shard Carrier until the start of that Glass Warrior's next turn.
text: >
  Glass Shards (1): If you hit Opponent(s) with an Attacking Maneuver of the Glass Profile, they become a ‘Shard Carrier’ until the start of your next turn.

---

# Nothing of its own: Glass Shards' other effects ask whether it is held.
